    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Mirce">Mirc.</ref> 3.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">7 for ðam cynedóme gebireð oðer swilc to bote on cynegilde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">and on account of the kingship there belongs a second sum as compensation in payment for a king.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And for ðam cynedome gebyrað oþer swilc to bote on cynegylde.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryTranslation" xml:lang="en">And for the kingship there is a second compensation owed equal to that of the king.</ab>
      </div>
